#: rust/crates/gtkhx-ui/src/options.rs:656
msgid ""
"Comma-separated words to highlight in chat (in addition to your own nick). "
"Matches are case-insensitive at word boundaries."
msgstr ""
"Palabras separadas por comas que se resaltarán en el chat (además de su "
